# Beethoven -- "Ode to Joy" (Symphony No. 9, 4th mvt). Public domain.
#
# The melody is deliberately plain, which makes it a good test: if the tune
# still reads when every note is replaced by a chord of the other 87 keys,
# the least-squares fit is carrying real pitch information.

tempo 112
meter 4

track melody
  E4:q E4 F4 G4  | G4 F4 E4 D4
  C4 C4 D4 E4    | E4:q. D4:e D4:h
  E4:q E4 F4 G4  | G4 F4 E4 D4
  C4 C4 D4 E4    | D4:q. C4:e C4:h

track bass gain 0.7
  C2:h C2  | G2:h G2
  C2:h G2  | G2:h C2
  C2:h C2  | G2:h G2
  C2:h G2  | G2:h C2
